<title>SOUTH AFRICA: STANDARD DIVISION APPOINTS NEW DIRECTORS.</title>
<headline>STANDARD DIVISION APPOINTS NEW DIRECTORS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Bank Investment Corp Ltd unit Standard Corporate and Merchant Bank (SCMB) on Thursday announced the appointments of Myles Ruck as deputy managing director and Ben Kruger as director of the treasury division.</p>
<p>Ruck, former director of corporate banking, replaces Mark Barnes who recently became chief executive officer of Capital Alliance Holdings Limited, the group said in a statement.</p>
<p>Capital Alliance at the end of November led black business consortium African Mining Group in its successful bid as new controlling stakeholders for South African mining house JCI Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
